    "detailed_description": "<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488050/extras/0642fc7fce18223a0dac0ad776503159.webp?t=1752718465\" /></span><br>A neighboring country has declared war!<br>The first war in a long time. Due to a shortage of personnel, Estelle, the princess, has taken command of the army.<br>She can't afford to lose this war, but... What will she do, Estelle!?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488050/extras/10a4458b75462c71f635abca9873f614.webp?t=1752718465\" /></span><br>Turn-based strategy SLG. You move soldiers as units and battle with the enemy army. <br>Status bonuses are granted to soldiers who achieve military success. <br>If you want more military funds, you can work part-time in the towns in your territory. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2488050/extras/fafd5f9fa0b034bea48021866e6e3cb6.webp?t=1752718465\" /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn-based strategy SLG<br></li><li>Main character fully voiced<br></li><li>Auto-play function</li></ul>",
